{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.046511627630418606,"w":0.11704312642415371,"h":0.013081395872223012,"t":"Introduction","x":0.80082135247067465},{"c":1,"y":0.090247331740388126,"h":0.017778606471058889,"w":0.63670511881510417,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","x":0.084109704865443002},{"c":1,"y":0.12783708916456615,"h":0.019367839171823054,"w":0.79896148681640611,"x":0.079983991554016809,"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading answer key you will find a chart which will help"},{"c":1,"x":0.079995474548888598,"w":0.78663513183593758,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your practice test results, you are ready to take the","y":0.14550416344095374,"h":0.019703449260520367},{"x":0.079880255575825648,"y":0.16406766627731295,"h":0.014106744861884124,"t":"IELTS test.","c":1,"w":0.10520750045776367},{"y":0.18157541473800787,"w":0.76816136678059899,"h":0.019514946951627032,"c":1,"x":0.10256045825581396,"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your"},{"w":0.81122548421223961,"c":1,"y":0.19902849215686502,"h":0.018270751367979621,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","x":0.082073052431815841},{"h":0.019340058273270344,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which is","x":0.080011361295457092,"w":0.78658289591471353,"y":0.21777567553964083,"c":1},{"t":"the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering your","x":0.079920747086684965,"y":0.23421943871707129,"w":0.80932225545247394,"h":0.021640289216618314,"c":1},{"t":"application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Band Score for","y":0.25427728635449842,"w":0.77412729899088562,"h":0.014749262536873253,"x":0.08008214088289406,"c":1},{"y":0.26995831909897083,"w":0.80316151936848956,"c":1,"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a","x":0.079950359150274625,"h":0.020629230150430944},{"h":0.022394437986840821,"x":0.079955872427147856,"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and writing,","y":0.28726558018938908,"c":1,"w":0.8154999287923177},{"t":"but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be","h":0.018928379295146458,"c":1,"y":0.30696485290254172,"x":0.079994283867989679,"w":0.82973129272460933},{"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","x":0.079965745421280585,"c":1,"w":0.83185460408528644,"h":0.021464333773362654,"y":0.32359360165921647},{"h":0.020337463198861538,"w":0.80301727294921876,"c":1,"y":0.34174379842564084,"x":0.080005955866220876,"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the"},{"w":0.24435317993164063,"h":0.015988371857499684,"y":0.36046511638962964,"c":1,"x":0.080082136829044373,"t":"Overall Band Score was 7."},{"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening","w":0.78868723551432285,"y":0.37766256145511479,"h":0.019536102204899652,"c":1,"x":0.10257113412670378},{"c":1,"x":0.08000902249101681,"w":0.7989127604166667,"h":0.018517331598782549,"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","y":0.39638958790266643},{"w":0.82766688028971358,"h":0.019128694787489686,"x":0.080009057529825706,"c":1,"y":0.41433970836069045,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready"},{"t":"to take the test.","h":0.015987540276001466,"c":1,"x":0.077753344453666953,"y":0.43183464956540041,"w":0.14435047149658203},{"y":0.44995522171353852,"c":1,"t":"The practice tests have been checked to ensure that they are the same level of difficulty","x":0.10258801843497452,"w":0.7886709594726562,"h":0.018866576698325588},{"y":0.46693083606179353,"c":1,"h":0.02117296066959351,"w":0.80926767985026038,"x":0.077911916802376399,"t":"as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the practice tests"},{"y":0.48566144096469444,"h":0.019469280861823535,"t":"will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The practice tests can only give you an idea of your","x":0.077940917252354414,"w":0.81126739501953138,"c":1},{"h":0.018655629565933807,"t":"possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions based on","w":0.76808822631835938,"y":0.50390267350605555,"c":1,"x":0.077974957684461305},{"x":0.080082135498957999,"t":"your score.","w":0.10266940434773762,"h":0.011627907316944963,"y":0.52470930214256117,"c":1},{"h":0.020832847212619798,"c":1,"y":0.53783711098963849,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have","w":0.80110071818033846,"x":0.10048124899344249},{"c":1,"x":0.077954468184920911,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept.","y":0.55747891869781452,"w":0.82972610473632813,"h":0.018715069638592596},{"h":0.020696143766420039,"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","x":0.079963652682936773,"y":0.57494329372108166,"w":0.82978210449218737,"c":1},{"y":0.58939591203851183,"w":0.20850400288899737,"x":0.077580028828460906,"h":0.021294677644352666,"t":"most other institutions.","c":1},{"w":0.022587269147237188,"y":0.91715116309896072,"c":1,"h":0.018895347842776355,"t":"9","x":0.89117043103213101}]}